Copyright (c) 2026 Nar / 那不然

This is an independent macOS companion project, not an official DevSpace release.
Upstream: https://github.com/Waishnav/devspace
Integration target: @waishnav/devspace 1.0.8 (MIT).

DevSpace provides MCP, workspace, file and command execution capabilities.
This project provides a local permission-management UI, access generations,
controlled permission changes, process tracking, a read-only discovery tool,
and launch integrations. Upstream implementation excerpts used as patch anchors
in src/install.mjs remain attributable to DevSpace contributors.

The DevSpace MIT notice is reproduced in docs/DEVSPACE-LICENSE.txt.
Express and its dependencies are installed through npm and retain their own
license notices. No installed upstream package, credentials, deployment state,
or private service configuration is distributed in this repository.
